% TOOLBOX IGNORE FILE
% Files and folders excluded from the .mltbx, one per line, relative to the
% toolbox root. Syntax: folder/ (whole folder), folder/* (its contents),
% folder/** (contents and subfolders), *.ext, **/*.ext (in all subfolders),
% file.ext, folder/file.ext, **/file.ext. A leading '%' must be written as
% '\%'. This file itself is never packaged.
%
% What ships: phx/, examples/, doc/GettingStarted.mlx, the license files and
% phx_logo.png (the toolbox image); the packager adds its own README.md and
% resources/*.json.

% Repository and development folders
.git/
.gitignore
.claude/
resources/
tools/
tests/
release/
publications/
customer/
doc/logo/

% Repository documents (not **/*.md - the agent skills in phx/skills ship)
README.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
CODE_REVIEW.md
CLAUDE.md
deploymentLog.html
**/*.gif

% Developer-only parts of the toolbox
phx/+phx/+engine/*.pdb
phx/+phx/+engine/bullet_*.*
phx/+phx/+engine/switchEngine.*
phx/+phx/+extra/Editor.m
phx/doc/custom_toolbox.json

% Scene builders of the Simulink examples (their saved_*.mat scenes ship)
examples/model_*.*
examples/res/Buggy*.*

% Build outputs, project files, backups and caches
**/*.mltbx
**/*.prj
**/*.asv
**/*.bak
**/slprj
**/.buildtool/
